The RML conformance test suites used for testing are referenced as git
submodules, not copied into this repository's tree. Their contents are not
covered by RMLrs's Apache-2.0 license. Check each upstream repository and
file's terms before redistributing a checkout with initialized submodules.

At the pinned revisions, the rml-io-registry and rml-lv submodules do not
have a repository-wide LICENSE file. Some files state their own terms, but
this does not establish terms for every test case. Their licensing should be
clarified upstream before redistributing those test suites. The submodules
come from the W3C KG-Construct Community Group repositories
(https://github.com/kg-construct), the old RML test cases
(https://github.com/RMLio/rml-test-cases), and the W3C R2RML test cases as
packaged in https://github.com/kg-construct/r2rml-test-cases-support.
